// Where DROP itself lives on GitHub, as owner/name. This is the only place the repository is
// named: Info.plist, the update feed URL, the scripts and the release workflow all read it from
// here, so renaming the repository is a one-line change. GitHub redirects the old name, so
// installed copies keep finding their updates after a rename.

DROP_REPO_SLUG = kirikakaese/DROP-BETA
